  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti Earthquake - Emergency Assistance in SUD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti is facing a deteriorating security situation; gang clashes, looting, and violent protests are frequent, and food insecurities have reached &quot;famine&quot; level. Cholera has also returned after a year-long absence, affecting thousands of people, but many hospitals cannot operate due to security concerns and fuel shortages. This crisis comes on the heels of the devastating 7.2 magnitude earthquake that struck southern Haiti in August 2021, leaving thousands of people homeless.</narrative>
  </description>
